@startuml state-machine-us085
title US085 – FlightPlan status lifecycle (US085 owns VALIDATED → TESTED)

skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #D6EAF8
    BorderColor #5B9BD5
    FontColor #1A1A1A
}

[*] --> DRAFT : create flight (US080)

DRAFT --> VALIDATED : import & validate DSL\n(US121 – lex/syn/sem, US120)

VALIDATED --> TESTED : **test passes (US085)**\n§3.3 fuel + altitude OK,\ndeparture consistent

VALIDATED --> VALIDATED : test fails (US085) /\nstate unchanged (R5)

TESTED --> VALIDATED : attach / detach / swap weather\n(US082 – voids the test, not the DSL)

DRAFT --> VALIDATED : re-import (US121)
VALIDATED --> DRAFT : re-import supersedes DSL\n(US121 – demote)

note right of TESTED
  Reached only by US085's guarded
  Flight.testCurrentPlan() → FlightPlan.markTested():
  promotes ONLY a VALIDATED plan (Invariant, R4).
end note

note bottom of VALIDATED
  US085 recompiles the immutable DSL blob and overlays the
  pilot's attached weather; the parsed structure is derived
  on demand, never persisted (design-notes §1).
end note

@enduml